{"seq":2,"slug":"building-integrated-renewables","title":"建筑光伏一体化与可再生能源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/energy-and-systems/building-integrated-renewables","wordCount":2221,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"建筑光伏一体化与可再生能源\">建筑光伏一体化与可再生能源</h1><p>把发电设备从「装在建筑上的附件」变成「构成建筑的材料」，是这一节要讲清的核心转变。屋顶支架上的常规组件只是把建筑当成支撑结构；而光伏一体化（BIPV，Building-Integrated Photovoltaics）让光伏直接替代幕墙玻璃、屋面瓦、遮阳百叶或栏板——发电只是这块建材的「副业」。这个转变在 2026 年从工程选项变成了法规义务：根据修订后的欧盟《建筑能效指令》（EPBD）第 10 条，自 2026 年 12 月 31 日起所有新建非住宅建筑必须部署适配的太阳能设施，新建住宅则从 2029 年底起执行（<a href=\"https://www.pv-tech.org/eu-to-improve-energy-performance-of-buildings-rooftop-solar-required-to-be-installed-from-2027/\">PV Tech</a>、<a href=\"https://www.solarpowereurope.org/press-releases/eu-rooftop-solar-standard-alone-could-solar-power-56-million-homes\">SolarPower Europe</a>）。当「建筑能源与系统电气化」要求把供暖、热水与交通负荷都搬到电网上，本地发电就不再是锦上添花，而是支撑这套电气化负荷的第一道电源——而这套负荷的规模上限又取决于围护做得多好，详见 <a href=\"high-performance-envelope\">高性能围护结构与超低能耗</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从附加到一体-从发电到协同\">核心概念：从附加到一体，从发电到协同</h2><p>理解建筑可再生能源，关键是把它放进「发电—蓄能—用电」的闭环里看，而不是孤立地谈一块板的效率。一栋零碳建筑的能源系统通常由四类角色协同：本地发电（屋顶/立面光伏、必要时配光热）、储能（电池、热水箱、相变蓄热）、电气化负荷（热泵、电热水、电动车充电），以及把它们调度起来的能源管理系统（EMS）。BIPV 是其中发电这一环的「建材化」形态，而真正决定碳排表现的是整套系统的自发自用率与时序匹配。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  SUN[太阳辐射] --&gt; BIPV[建筑光伏一体化&lt;br/&gt;屋顶 立面 遮阳]&#10;  BIPV --&gt; EMS[能源管理系统 EMS&lt;br/&gt;预测 调度 优化]&#10;  EMS --&gt; LOAD[电气化负荷&lt;br/&gt;热泵 电热水 EV充电]&#10;  EMS --&gt; BATT[电池储能&lt;br/&gt;移峰填谷]&#10;  EMS --&gt; THERM[热储能&lt;br/&gt;水箱 相变材料]&#10;  EMS &lt;--&gt; GRID[配电网&lt;br/&gt;余电上网 需求响应]&#10;  BATT --&gt; LOAD&#10;  THERM --&gt; LOAD&#10;  LOAD --&gt; SERVICE[建筑用能服务&lt;br/&gt;采暖 制冷 生活热水]\">flowchart TD\n  SUN[太阳辐射] --&gt; BIPV[建筑光伏一体化&lt;br/&gt;屋顶 立面 遮阳]\n  BIPV --&gt; EMS[能源管理系统 EMS&lt;br/&gt;预测 调度 优化]\n  EMS --&gt; LOAD[电气化负荷&lt;br/&gt;热泵 电热水 EV充电]\n  EMS --&gt; BATT[电池储能&lt;br/&gt;移峰填谷]\n  EMS --&gt; THERM[热储能&lt;br/&gt;水箱 相变材料]\n  EMS &lt;--&gt; GRID[配电网&lt;br/&gt;余电上网 需求响应]\n  BATT --&gt; LOAD\n  THERM --&gt; LOAD\n  LOAD --&gt; SERVICE[建筑用能服务&lt;br/&gt;采暖 制冷 生活热水]</pre><p>下表对比常规屋面光伏（BAPV，附加式）与几类一体化形态，帮助理解为什么 BIPV 的价值不能只用「每瓦发电成本」衡量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>替代的建材</th>\n<th>典型组件效率（2026）</th>\n<th>主要价值</th>\n<th>主要挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>BAPV 屋顶附加</td>\n<td>无（额外加装）</td>\n<td>22%–24% 单晶</td>\n<td>成本最低、改造快</td>\n<td>不计入建材，纯增量投资</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BIPV 屋面瓦/卷材</td>\n<td>屋面防水层</td>\n<td>18%–22%</td>\n<td>防水+发电双功能</td>\n<td>散热差、隐裂检测难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BIPV 光伏幕墙玻璃</td>\n<td>幕墙/采光玻璃</td>\n<td>半透明 5%–12%</td>\n<td>立面发电+采光+美观</td>\n<td>朝向受限、透光率与发电权衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BIPV 遮阳/栏板</td>\n<td>遮阳百叶、阳台栏板</td>\n<td>18%–20%</td>\n<td>一举兼顾遮阳与发电</td>\n<td>角度优化、阴影自遮挡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"一体化的器件基础-效率-双面与钙钛矿\">一体化的器件基础：效率、双面与钙钛矿</h2><p>BIPV 长期的痛点是「好看的不高效，高效的不好看」——幕墙要透光、要颜色、要适配非最优朝向，而这些都在削减发电。2026 年改变这个权衡的，是钙钛矿/硅叠层（tandem）电池的工程化落地。2025 年 4 月，隆基（LONGi）的钙钛矿-硅叠层电池在美国国家可再生能源实验室（NREL）认证下达到 34.85% 的转换效率（<a href=\"https://www.greenlancer.com/post/solar-panel-technology-trends\">GreenLancer</a>）；商用化的两端单片叠层组件认证效率已达 27.9%–28.2%（<a href=\"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/ifm2.70015\">Wiley IFM</a>）。叠层之所以对建筑特别重要，是它把更多电功率挤进同样的面积——在屋面与立面可用面积都受限的城市建筑里，单位面积功率比单瓦成本更稀缺。</p>\n<p>钙钛矿还带来 BIPV 急需的两个特性：颜色可调与半透明。柔性、可调色的钙钛矿电池让立面在保持建筑美学的同时发电，应用已扩展到光伏窗、玻璃幕墙、声屏障乃至农业光伏（<a href=\"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/ifm2.70015\">Wiley IFM</a>）。立面的另一招是双面（bifacial）器件：双面叠层能利用环境反射的杂散光，相对单面结构带来 9%–26% 的年发电量增益，理想条件下功率提升可达 17%（<a href=\"https://www.patsnap.com/resources/blog/rd-blog/bifacial-perovskite-solar-cells-2026-patsnap-eureka/\">PatSnap</a>）。这对垂直安装、本就无法对准最优倾角的幕墙是关键补偿。</p>\n<p>半透明组件的工程权衡可以用一个朴素关系描述：透光率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 越高，可吸收的光子越少，面积功率密度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>area</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{area}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">area</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越低。若设组件面积为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>、对应辐照下的发电效率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、入射辐照为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>，则该立面单元的发电功率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = \\eta(\\tau) \\cdot G \\cdot A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 单调下降。设计采光幕墙时，正是在「室内自然采光质量」与「立面发电量」之间沿这条曲线取点——这也是 BIPV 区别于普通光伏的根本：它要同时满足建筑物理（采光、隔热、遮阳）和电气两套约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"系统协同-自发自用-储能与电气化负荷\">系统协同：自发自用、储能与电气化负荷</h2><p>只发电不解决问题。城市建筑的发电高峰在正午，而用电高峰在傍晚（人回家、做饭、充电），两者错位。衡量一栋楼真实价值的指标是自发自用率（self-consumption ratio），即本地发电中被本地直接消纳的比例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>sc</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>self</mtext></msub><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>gen</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{sc}} = \\frac{E_{\\text{self}}}{E_{\\text{gen}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gen</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">self</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>提高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>sc</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{sc}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 有两条路：把负荷搬到发电时段（柔性调度），以及把电量在时间上搬移（储能）。这正是「电气化负荷」在零碳系统里既是问题也是资产的原因——热泵、电热水箱、电动车充电桩都是可调度的弹性负荷。IEA 指出，要安全且经济地消纳风光，越来越需要智能电动车充电桩、热泵、短期与长期储能以及可调度电源协同（<a href=\"https://www.iea.org/energy-system/renewables\">IEA Renewables</a>）。</p>\n<p>热泵在这套协同里是主角而非配角。把光伏与热泵耦合——光伏直驱热泵制热并以水箱/相变材料蓄热——被视为迈向零碳建筑的有力方案。这里有一个常被忽略的杠杆：热泵的性能系数（COP）让一度光伏电能可转化为三到四度的供热（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>el</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>heat</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>COP</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{el}} = Q_{\\text{heat}}/\\text{COP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">el</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">heat</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">COP</span></span></span></span></span></span>，COP 取 3–4），意味着本地有限的发电量经热泵放大后能覆盖远超其名义功率的供暖负荷。热泵的工作原理、冷气候出力、制冷剂法规与电网调度详见 <a href=\"hvac-electrification-heat-pumps\">暖通空调电气化与热泵</a>。BIPV/T（光伏光热一体化）更进一步，让一块组件同时产电、产热并回收背板余热以降温提效，配合相变材料与热管在密集城区显著提升综合产出（<a href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2352710225025215\">ScienceDirect, BIPV/T 系统综述</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"政策驱动与市场现状-从合规到资产\">政策驱动与市场现状：从合规到资产</h2><p>2026 年 BIPV 不再靠情怀推动，而是被法规和电费账单共同拉动。欧盟的屋顶光伏标准被估计能在 2026–2030 年间新增 150–200 GW 屋顶光伏装机（<a href=\"https://european.realestate/solar-ready-2026-what-european-building-mandates-mean-for-you/\">European Real Estate</a>）。修订版 EPBD 把新建标准从 NZEB 抬升到零排放建筑（ZEB），并要求所有新建「太阳能就绪」（solar-ready）——这条条款对设计师的影响最直接：屋面荷载、立面朝向、桥架与逆变器位置必须在方案阶段就考虑，而非交付后补装（EPBD 的 ZEB 定义、太阳能强制时间线与全生命周期 GWP 框架详见 <a href=\"../certification-policy-practice/net-zero-policy-and-codes\">零碳政策与建筑节能法规</a>）。</p>\n<p>市场规模仍处在快速但口径分散的扩张期。不同机构对 2026 年全球 BIPV 市场的估值从约 78 亿美元到 326 亿美元不等，差异主要来自是否计入幕墙玻璃整体价值（<a href=\"https://www.knowledge-sourcing.com/report/building-integrated-photovoltaics-market\">Knowledge Sourcing</a>、<a href=\"https://www.businessresearchinsights.com/market-reports/building-integrated-photovoltaics-bipv-market-114906\">Business Research Insights</a>）。区域上欧洲领跑，2025 年贡献全球约 41.8% 份额、约 97.8 亿美元，预计 2026 年达 117.3 亿美元，主要由严格能效法规驱动（<a href=\"https://www.cervicornconsulting.com/building-integrated-photovoltaics-market\">Cervicorn Consulting</a>）。在系统视角下，太阳能光伏也是目前唯一与 2050 净零（NZE）情景轨迹相符的可再生技术（<a href=\"https://www.iea.org/energy-system/renewables\">IEA Renewables</a>）——这意味着把它建材化、规模化地嵌入建筑，是少有的「方向已确定」的减碳路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>BIPV 的本质是「发电建材」：用光伏替代幕墙、屋面、遮阳与栏板，价值要按系统而非单板效率评估。</li>\n<li>2026 年是法规拐点：欧盟 EPBD 第 10 条令新建非住宅建筑年底起强制太阳能、所有新建筑「solar-ready」，并把标准升至零排放建筑（ZEB）。</li>\n<li>器件层面，钙钛矿/硅叠层（NREL 认证最高 34.85%、商用约 28%）+ 双面技术（9%–26% 增益）+ 可调色半透明，正在化解 BIPV「好看 vs 高效」的老矛盾。</li>\n<li>系统层面，自发自用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>sc</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{sc}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与时序匹配才是碳排关键；热泵（COP 3–4 放大本地电）、电池与热储能、EMS 调度把电气化负荷从问题变成弹性资产。</li>\n<li>市场快速扩张但估值口径分散（2026 年约 78–326 亿美元），欧洲领跑（约占 41.8%）；光伏是唯一与 2050 净零轨迹相符的可再生技术，建材化嵌入建筑是方向明确的减碳路径。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"建筑光伏一体化与可再生能源","id":"建筑光伏一体化与可再生能源"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从附加到一体，从发电到协同","id":"核心概念-从附加到一体-从发电到协同"},{"level":2,"text":"一体化的器件基础：效率、双面与钙钛矿","id":"一体化的器件基础-效率-双面与钙钛矿"},{"level":2,"text":"系统协同：自发自用、储能与电气化负荷","id":"系统协同-自发自用-储能与电气化负荷"},{"level":2,"text":"政策驱动与市场现状：从合规到资产","id":"政策驱动与市场现状-从合规到资产"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高性能围护结构与超低能耗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/energy-and-systems/high-performance-envelope"},"next":{"title":"暖通空调电气化与热泵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/energy-and-systems/hvac-electrification-heat-pumps"}}